ds and the current tests pass. I need to make sure my rewrite doesn't break any tests. Let me re-check what each test checks:\n\n- Test 3: frontmatter starts with `---`, has `name:` with `okf-knowledge-read`, has `description:`\n- Test 4: `## 什么时候用` in content\n- Test 5: `## 前置准备` in content\n- Test 6: `## 运行` or `## 配置参数` or `## 运行参数` - if I use `## 运行`, test still passes\n- Test 7: \"发现知识库\", \"匹配概念\", \"加载文档\", \"追踪链接\", \"注入上下文\" keywords\n- Test 8: \"type-registry\" or \"type_registry\" or \"type registry\" or \"内置\"\n- Test 9: \"不是有效的\" or \"非法\" or \"无效\" or \"报错\"\n- Test 10: \"断链\" or \"失效\" or \"链接已失效\" or \"broken\"\n\nGood, my rewrite will maintain all these keywords.\n\nLet me compose the new SKILL.md now.","signature":"ded86a07-c043-4d70-9681-adca0e070424"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":147,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":51200,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f70e98a5-8832-400f-9dda-46f605c73a84","uuid":"f6cf02fc-df29-4a37-8b05-b4c78fa111c6"}
